## Architecture Diagram

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    U[User Input] --> FE[React Frontend]
    FE -->|POST /chat| BE[FastAPI Backend]
    BE --> RAG[RAG Service\nFAISS + sentence-transformers]
    RAG -->|top-k context| BE
    BE --> AI[OpenAI GPT-4o-mini]
    AI -->|structured JSON| BE
    BE --> MEM[Memory Service\nError Store]
    MEM --> RAG
    BE -->|ChatResponse| FE
    FE --> UI[Highlighted Corrections\n+ Score Ring]
```

---

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- `pytest backend/tests/` — unit tests for prompt builder, JSON parser, RAG retrieval
- Manual: `curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/chat -d '{"user_id":"test","message":"I goes to school"}'`

### Manual Verification
1. Submit a sentence with grammar errors → verify correction + JSON structure
2. Submit the same error twice → verify RAG context shows it in the 2nd response
3. Submit a 250-word IELTS Task 2 essay → verify band estimate + feedback
4. Check logs in `backend/data/logs.jsonl`

